    "description": "<p>Upgrade your travel experience with our <strong>Personalized Luggage Tag</strong>, designed to keep your bags safe, stylish, and easy to identify. Whether you're at the airport, railway station, or hotel check-in, this custom tag ensures your luggage stands out instantly.</p><p>Crafted from <strong>high-quality, waterproof, and scratch-resistant material</strong>, the tag is built to handle rough travel conditions. You can customize it with <strong>your name, initials, contact number, or even your profession</strong>, making it ideal for both personal and professional use.</p><p>The strong buckle strap keeps the tag securely attached to any suitcase, backpack, or duffle bag. Its bold color and clean typography make spotting your luggage effortless.</p><h3>⭐ <strong>Key Features</strong></h3><p>Personalized with your <strong>Name, Phone Number, or ID</strong></p><p>Waterproof, durable &amp; long-lasting material</p><p>Strong strap for secure attachment</p><p>Perfect for suitcases, cabin bags, backpacks &amp; office travel bags</p><p>Helps avoid lost luggage and makes identification quick</p><p>Suitable for <strong>frequent travelers, doctors, students, and business professionals</strong></p>",
